    <artifactId>devices-ide</artifactId>
    <packaging>jar</packaging>
    <name>IDE and MMC stack</name>
    <!--
      What the cards and the boards that carry them are made of: a channel with two drives on it,
      a disk image behind each, an SD card spoken to over SPI, and the two shapes of board that
      page a ROM to reach them. Not a device: no machine has one, and nobody plugs this in. It is
      what the six that ARE devices - DivIDE, DivMMC, Simple 8-bit IDE, ZXATASP, ZXCF, ZXMMC -
      are built out of, the way the kit is what their windows are built out of.
    -->
</project>
